sequenceDiagram
    participant browser
    participant server

    %% --- Loading existing notes ---
    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/notes
    activate server
    server-->>browser: HTML document
    deactivate server

    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/main.css
    activate server
    server-->>browser: CSS file
    deactivate server

    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/main.js
    activate server
    server-->>browser: JavaScript file
    deactivate server

    Note right of browser: Browser executes JS that fetches existing notes
    browser->>server: GET https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/data.json
    activate server
    server-->>browser: [{ "content": "HTML is easy", "date": "2023-1-1" }, ...]
    deactivate server
    Note right of browser: Browser renders the notes on the page

    %% --- Creating a new note ---
    Note left of browser: User types a new note in the text field
    browser->>browser: Browser prepares new note as JSON
    Note right of browser: e.g., { "content": "Learn Mermaid diagrams", "date": "2026-02-16" }

    browser->>server: POST https://studies.cs.helsinki.fi/exampleapp/notes
    activate server
    Note right of server: Server receives new note JSON and saves it
    server-->>browser: { "id": 124, "content": "Learn Mermaid diagrams", "date": "2026-02-16" }
    deactivate server

    Note right of browser: Browser adds the new note to the displayed list
